{{!
    @template tool_vae/correspondence_page

    The page of the correspondences of a replaced record, below its heading: what a correspondence is, the way back to the
    replaced records, the error of a decision refused, and the table of the competencies with the form of each.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\correspondence_page. The template holds no logic. Every
    text and address is escaped (double braces), except two keys of HTML (triple braces): errorhtml, a notification made by
    the core ($output->notification(), its message escaped); tablehtml, a table drawn by the template tool_vae/table (its
    codes, names and notes are escaped by the template tool_vae/cell_content, the labels formatted by format_string(), the
    forms drawn by the template tool_vae/correspondence_decision_form).

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * intro - string, what a correspondence is
    * back - {url, label}: the way back to the replaced records
    * errorhtml - false, or HTML: the error of a decision refused
    * tablehtml - HTML: the table of the competencies

    Example context (json):
    {
        "intro": "For each competency of the replaced record, the plugin suggests one of the record that replaces it.",
        "back": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/supersession.php", "label": "Back to the replaced records"},
        "errorhtml": false,
        "tablehtml": "<table class=\"generaltable\"><tbody><tr><td>DEMO-GRAND-AGE-BC01</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    }
}}
<p>{{intro}}</p>
{{#back}}
<a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a>
{{/back}}
{{#errorhtml}}
{{{errorhtml}}}
{{/errorhtml}}
{{{tablehtml}}}
